  "description": "Vali-Mediator is a lightweight .NET library for implementing the Mediator pattern with CQRS support. It simplifies request handling, pipeline behaviors, and event notifications through a fluent and extensible API. Now, using the Saga pattern, it introduces compensation flows to automatically handle remediation for failed operations, ensuring data consistency in distributed systems. Designed for seamless integration with dependency injection, it enables developers to manage commands, queries, notifications, and compensatory actions efficiently.",
  "iconFile": "logo.png",
  "id": "Vali-Mediator",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-04-07T22:53:30.707Z",
  "licenseExpression": "Apache-2.0",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/Apache-2.0",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "Tj4QMg5rCIKQYvDaZHZJ/lVL2bxZBHTsb0gkkPyCYa62XqvZUs6GoNqcnMpkkAncAZN2odVag1fnmdq0VKPluA==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 61811,
  "published": "2025-04-07T22:50:25.827Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Vali-Mediator v1.1.0 introduces significant improvements for more robust and resilient operations in distributed systems:\n            - Support for `IFireAndForget` commands, enabling asynchronous operations without the need to wait for an immediate response. Ideal for \"fire-and-forget\" scenarios such as notifications or event logging.\n            - Incorporation of a compensation flow based on the Saga pattern, which provides automatic remediation in case of normal flow failure. This mechanism ensures data consistency by executing compensatory actions if an error occurs, enhancing reliability in distributed transactions.\n            Continues to support .NET 7, 8, and 9, while maintaining features for CQRS, pipeline behaviors, and notification handling.",
  "repository": "",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "Vali-Mediator",
